                <td class="news_date" align="right"><span class="news_writer">오로IN</span> &nbsp;2023-12-02 오후 06:12&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[<a href="JavaScript:MM_openBrWindow('news_print.oro?news_no=530349','print', 'width=640, height=450, scrollbars=yes');" class="gray11">프린트</a><!-- ｜<a href="/myinfo/myscrapsave.oro?skind=1&sc_num=530349&gdiv=1" class="gray11">스크랩</a> -->]</td>
